  $\Underlying_{\mathrm{ms}}^{(n, m)}$ from $n\mathsf{Cat}_{\mathrm{ms}}$ to $m\mathsf{Cat}_{\mathrm{ms}}$ is the functor that maps every many-sorted
  $n$-category $\mathsf{C}$ to its underlying $m$-category $\mathsf{C}^{<m}$ and every many-sorted
